{"4378600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seema's Pogo 3 Hop Together", "steam_appid": 4378600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The long-awaited third game from the legendary game series, now with multiplayer for 64 players at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 3d-platformer, but instead of jumping by yourself you're using pogo, which was inspired by 3D Hopper tech demo for Nintendo 3DS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of your favourite cat characters (including Neco-Arc!), try yourself on 40 levels in different settings, and get ready to fall down. A lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >low system requirements (you can play it on everything that supports at least OpenGL 3.2)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ton of gameplay in a small size (10 hours in 650 MB)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lot of cool music from the unknown authors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 of your favourite cat characters (including PlanetClue and Neco Arc)</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The long-awaited third game from the legendary game series, now with multiplayer for 64 players at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 3d-platformer, but instead of jumping by yourself you're using pogo, which was inspired by 3D Hopper tech demo for Nintendo 3DS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of your favourite cat characters (including Neco-Arc!), try yourself on 40 levels in different settings, and get ready to fall down. A lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >low system requirements (you can play it on everything that supports at least OpenGL 3.2)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ton of gameplay in a small size (10 hours in 650 MB)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lot of cool music from t